  /// above, Redis OSS engine version 6.2 to 7.1 or Memcached engine version
  /// 1.6.6 and above on all instances built on the Nitro system .
  pub ip_discovery: IpDiscovery? = None
  /// A setting that allows you to migrate your clients to use in-transit
  /// encryption, with no downtime. When setting TransitEncryptionEnabled to
  /// true , you can set your TransitEncryptionMode to preferred in the same
  /// request, to allow both encrypted and unencrypted connections at the same
  /// time. Once you migrate all your Valkey or Redis OSS clients to use
  /// encrypted connections you can modify the value to required to allow
